        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86343, Traditional Spindle Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Urn Tip Thru-Bolt Door Pull has an elegant design suitable for traditional homes. This Spindle Door Handle is made by Emtek and comes packaged with the mounting hardware you'll need to install it on a wood, fiberglass, or metal door up to 1-3/4 inches thick. The Spindle Pull is available in 18 inch and 12 inch center to center lengths. It is available in a huge array of finishes for an end look that suits your style perfectly. \r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/urn-tip-back-to-back-door-pull-pair-emtek-btb-86343\"><b>Spindle Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Spindle Front Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86343-specification.pdf?v=1704262359\"><b>Emtek Spindle Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86343:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 15/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86344:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 15/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.<i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-9-finish.jpg?v=1704354579\" width=\"597\" height=\"89\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
